  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/967745/description_c0fb0a97-6fae-4153-9a6e-65a4d7d72ea4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/allthemods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/967745/description_3f558ee0-1f0a-4a42-a0e6-25b997872200.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"483\" height=\"116\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《All the Mods 9：直衝雲霄》是「All The Mods」天空主題整合包三部曲的壓軸之作。開發團隊採納了前兩代版本的反饋意見，致力於打造我們最優質的整合包。本整合包新增了其他版本未包含的模組，例如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forcecraft</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forgiving-void\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forgiving Void</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oreberries-replanted\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oreberries</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/utilitarian\" rel=\"nofollow\">Utilitarian</a>。我們希望這能成為迄今為止自由度最高的 ATM 整合包！</span><br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外還有 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ex-machinis-divitiae-deorum\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ex Machinis: Divitiae Deorum</a> 模組，這是 ATM 內部為《Ex Deorum》開發的自動化擴充套件，將帶領你從遊戲初期一路推進至後期全自動化資源收集。</span></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><br></span>`</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h6 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RhacdOJ3eqM\" width=\"390\" height=\"222\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/v7XcOBi8A5g\" width=\"390\" height=\"222\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span><span><iframe style=\"width:390px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xn7os2v3YbA\" width=\"390\" height=\"222\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:390px;float:right\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zqwp-5DagSk\" width=\"390\" height=\"222\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br>「All the Mods」真的包含&nbsp;</strong><strong>所有</strong><strong>&nbsp;模組嗎？當然不是。</strong></h6>",
